                                            </span>
                                        </span>
                                        <span lang="FR"
                                              style="font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: LiberationSans; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);">
                                             NEXCONEC SAS <span style="font-weight: bolder;">BANQUE </span>: CIC ST
                                            ETIENNE ENTREPRISES - <span style="font-weight: bolder;">SWIFT (BIC)
                                            :</span> CMCIFRPP
                                        </span>
                                        <br/>
                                        <span lang="FR"
                                              style="font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: LiberationSans; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);">
                                            <b>  ADRESSE BANQUE</b>
                                            : 3 RUE A BRIAND ET DE LA PAIX, 42000 ST ETIENNE
                                        </span>
                                        <br/>
                                        <span lang="FR"
                                              style="font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: LiberationSans; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);">
                                            <b>  IBAN EUR</b>
                                            : FR76 1009 6180 1700 0930 8330 153
                                        </span>
